WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.899
You create an invoice from the Billable charge items of an account. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:04.899 --> 00:00:09.491
Open the account, and select Create Invoice in the account header.

2.1
00:00:09.491 --> 00:00:16.784
Step 2. All Billable items start selected. Clear any you do not want on the invoice.

3.1
00:00:16.784 --> 00:00:22.090
Step 4. Optionally, open the Issue Date, Payment Terms and Note section.

3.2
00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:27.577
If you leave Issue Date empty, Care sets it when you issue the invoice.

4.1
00:00:27.577 --> 00:00:34.268
Step 5. Select Create Invoice. Care creates a Draft invoice and opens it.
